# FreeLook Amber: a Konsole color scheme in the spirit of the amber
# phosphor terminals, for FreeLook Night. Details differ by brightness,
# from deep orange to cream, rather than by hue.
#
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Saulo Popov Zambiasi <saulo.popov.zambiasi@ufsc.br>
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

